{"articleNo":"369897","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=369897&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] 2022학년도 국가근로장학금 하계방학 (교외)집중근로 희망근로지 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.05.23","hit":"16920","attachments":[{"name":"붙임1-1. 2022년 하계방학 집중근로 프로그램 희망근로지 신청 매뉴얼(학생용_홈페이지).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=369897&attachNo=112622"},{"name":"붙임1-2. 2022년 하계방학 집중근로 프로그램 희망근로지 신청 매뉴얼(학생용_모바일).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=369897&attachNo=112623"},{"name":"붙임2. 2022년 하계방학 집중근로 프로그램 근로장학생 사전 선정기준(안).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=369897&attachNo=112660"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2022</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학년도 국가근로장학금 하계방학 (교외)집중근로 프로그램 학생 신청기간 안내</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"><b></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2022</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학년도 국가근로장학금 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">\"</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">하계방학 교외 집중근로 프로그램</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">\" </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학생 희망근로지 신청기간을 아래와 같이 안내하오니 참고하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 2;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">■ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학생 희망근로지 신청</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">신청 기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">:&nbsp;</span><u style=\"font-family: 돋움;\"><b>2022. 5. 24.(화) 9시 ~ 2022. 6. 2.(목) 18시까지</b></u></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">※ 마감일 신청자 증가로 인해 신청이 어려울 수 있으므로 미리 신청하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">신청 대상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: 2022-1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학기 국가근로장학금 학생신청기간(</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">차</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">, 2</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">차, 추가신청) 재학생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">* 기본요건 : 직전학기 성적 70점/100점 만점(C0수준)이상이며, 학자금 지원 8구간 이하인 학생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">신청 방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">첨부파일 매뉴얼 참고</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">신청한 희망근로지 순위대로 사전선정 실시 예정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">최대 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">개 선택 가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">■&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">집중근로 운영기간(근로기간) : 2022. 7. 1.(금) ~ 8. 31.(수)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><b><br></b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><b><br></b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><b>★ 유의 사항</b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">① <b>희망근로지 선택 및 내용 작성 후</b></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><b>, 신청완료 버튼을 반드시 눌러야 함</b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">※</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(80, 80, 80); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">작성 후, 신청완료 버튼을 클릭하지 않아 참여를 못하는 사례가 많이 발생하고 있습니다. 최종 지원을 위해 신청완료 버튼을 반드시 눌러주세요.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(80, 80, 80); letter-spacing: 0px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">②&nbsp;</span><strong sizetype=\"px\" defaultsize=\"13\" currentsize=\"13\" style=\"color: rgb(80, 80, 80); font-family: &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;, Helvetica; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">근로지 업무내용, 근로기간, 시간, 위치 등을 반드시 확인 후 신청</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(본인 일정 확인 후 신청)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(80, 80, 80); letter-spacing: 0px;\">※ 신청 후 개인사정으로 취소하게 될 경우 불이익 발생할 수 있음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(80, 80, 80); letter-spacing: 0px;\">③ 대학 방학시작일 이후, 방학중 집중근로 진행 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(80, 80, 80); letter-spacing: 0px;\">④ 선발 결과 공개일 이후 근로 전&nbsp;반드시 기관 담당자와 연락 후 일정을 확인해야 함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; letter-spacing: 0px; color: rgb(80, 80, 80);\">※ 22년 1학기 국가장학금,국가근로 통합신청이 5.24.(화)부터 시작됨으로 혼동하지 않도록 유의</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(80, 80, 80); letter-spacing: 0px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">※ 근로기관&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(80, 80, 80); letter-spacing: 0px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">최종배정결과안내는 2022. 6. 23.(목) 확인 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(80, 80, 80); letter-spacing: 0px;\">※ 기관 사정으로 인해&nbsp;근로 가능한&nbsp;기관 명단이&nbsp;변경 될 수 있음</span></p><p sizetype=\"px\" defaultsize=\"13\" currentsize=\"13\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(80, 80, 80); letter-spacing: 0px; font-family: &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;, Helvetica; font-size: 13px;\"><span sizetype=\"px\" defaultsize=\"13\" currentsize=\"13\"><span sizetype=\"px\" defaultsize=\"13\" currentsize=\"13\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">☎&nbsp;</span><span sizetype=\"px\" defaultsize=\"13\" currentsize=\"13\" style=\"font-weight: bold; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">문의사항: 1599-2290</span></span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"11495\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentP